{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>葵涌發生墮樓案。昨晚（3日）11時許，警方接獲保安報案指，一名男子在葵福道85至89號晉昇工廠大廈高處墮下。警員和救護員接報到場，證實事主當場死亡，警方正調查事主身份，以及從工廈何處墮下。</p><p>就現場所見，遺體斷開4截，分別由黑袋遮掩，地面遺下血跡。</p><figure><img alt=\"遺體斷開多截，分別由黑袋遮掩。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172349513818705920786190.jpeg/LF6cPghekQqs8RreKYCITDo3zMC_BZM9UykGsmkpBrI\"/><figcaption>遺體斷開多截，分別由黑袋遮掩。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"遺體斷開多截，分別由黑袋遮掩，地面遺下血跡。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172349516515774464697423.jpeg/jBafkHXoIJt88AbO1X9PvL70FPxl8BuIgzPR6rkz0eo\"/><figcaption>遺體斷開多截，分別由黑袋遮掩，地面遺下血跡。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172349510823841792192857.jpeg/s_61x_y1bDTso16tC3Mg4H-bqbSCppgereKCXpfigl4\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172349507942223872973508.jpeg/rIfcszETRu5RNoJYesKxAx_O2FIurYyu9ITn9c6E5_U\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T17:19:30.556958+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}